.SH NAME
inspekt\-network \- Show network requests from the current page.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]inspekt\f[R] \f[B]network\f[R] [\f[I]OPTIONS\f[R]]
\f[I]SUBCOMMAND\f[R] [\f[I]ARGS\f[R]]\&...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show network requests from the current page.
.PP
Displays all network requests made by the page using the Performance
API.
Includes timing breakdown, transfer sizes, and cache status.
.PP
\f[B]Options:\f[R]
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]\-\-json\f[R]: Output as JSON
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]\-\-sort\f[R]: Sort by field (start, time, size, name, type)
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]\-\-domain\f[R]: Show domain column
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]\-\-external\f[R]: Show only external requests
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]\-\-limit\f[R]: Limit number of results
.PP
\f[B]Subcommands:\f[R]
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]har\f[R]: Get full HAR data (requires DevTools open)
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]errors\f[R]: Show only failed requests
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]slow\f[R]: Show slowest requests
